abstract: >
  Guata LCP Analysis ia a Least Cost Path pipeline for archaeological spatial analysis using GRASS GIS.
  Computes accumulated cost surfaces from a DEM using Tobler, Herzog or Langmuir
  cost functions, generates least cost paths between origin and destination point
  grids, and produces a path density raster.
